module_doc "The nodes the checker writes into the tree, which the dump of the parsed\ntree cannot hold: the read and the write of an atomic field, `p?.x`,\n`to_slice` of an iterator, the built-ins of a simd struct, `mul_high`, a\ncall whose error the `catch` of its block takes, and the bound names of a\n`switch` on a variant and of a `select`, and the descriptor of the interface\nthat `instance` of a library takes."
